        "author_name": "Halima Diallo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108528299507013313879/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrxsxOp3EJ98r4nkdHc8Zk9Jw-OZnp52fEFdtUaSnOp2YQaw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Very disappointing experience. At the time of selling the turf, Derek was very responsive and friendly. He made it seem like he was offering me a discount, but in reality, he removed items (like infill) without clearly telling me. Later, he sent an email saying he “made a mistake” and removed extra costs — framing it as if he was giving me a special deal.\nAfter the installation, he completely disappeared. He promised to send me the product warranty but never did. For almost $4,000, all they did was glue artificial grass on my concrete. no big preparation, no landscaping, nothing else ( just a broom). On top of that, they left an area uncovered, leaving it looking unfinished and not aesthetically pleasing.\n\nWhen I tried to follow up, I was told that I got a “good offer,” which is insulting considering the lack of work done. Derek is not honest and ignores clients once the job is finished. I regret not going with another company\nI do not recommend this company.",
        "time": 1755185329,
        "translated": false
